/**
 * ISL Dictionary — Extensible sign vocabulary database.
 *
 * Design principles:
 * - Each entry has a stable ID, gloss, synonyms, category, trilingual meanings, and model coverage.
 * - Adding a new entry does NOT require any UI code change.
 * - `modelSupported` is tracked separately from dictionary presence.
 *   A word can exist in the dictionary without being in the recognition model vocabulary.
 * - `demoVideo` is null unless a licensed, properly attributed video is available.
 * - All attributions reference the original dataset/source.
 */

